<title>JAPAN: Nippon Kodoshi -6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Nippon Kodoshi -6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to September 30, 1996</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		  4.95		vs	    5.36</p>
<p> Operating	  298    million	  vs	  652    million</p>
<p> Current	    269    million	  vs	  534    million</p>
<p> Net		  129    million	  vs	  403    million</p>
<p> EPS		   14.19 yen	  vs	   56.55 yen</p>
<p> Shares		9 million	  vs	   7 million</p>
<p> Interim div	  7.50 yen	  vs	    7.50 yen</p>
<p>NOTE - Nippon Kodoshi Co Ltd is a specialised maker of paper for insulation.</p>
</text>
